TOPOLOGY MAP — CONTRACT

State space: X carrying τ(M)
Admissible action: L_g : X → X
Topology-and-flow preservation:
    P_τ(g, x) = 1 iff the manifold and flow snapshots at L_g(x)
    remain continuous across the action.

Curvature-preserving actions additionally satisfy:
    κ(L_g(x)) = κ(x) for every x in τ(M).

The admission API evaluates topology continuity for each transformed cycle
state. The live submission interface compares the supplied before/after
manifold and flow snapshots; finite samples do not establish domain-wide
preservation.
